05081 1145 "For a function $f(x)$ to be a valid probability density function on a set $S,$ it must satisfy the following conditions:\n\n- $f(x)\\ge 0$ for all $x\\in S$\n\n- ${\\int }_{S}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x=1$\n\nFor the given function, the second condition states that\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{-1}^{0}(k-x)\\,\\text{d}x=1.\n$$\n\nComputing the integral on the left-hand side, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{-1}^{0}(k-x)\\,\\text{d}x & ={[kx-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{2}]}_{-1}^{0} \\\\  & =0-[-k-\\frac{1}{2}] \\\\  & =k+\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\nk+\\frac{1}{2}=1\\,⟹\\,k=\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$" 13194139534714 true] [17592186305082 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305083 13194139534714 true] [17592186305082 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305084 13194139534714 true] [17592186305082 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305085 13194139534714 true] [17592186305082 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305086 13194139534714 true] [17592186305082 1000 #edb/ref 17592186305087 13194139534714 true] [17592186305082 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534714 true] [17592186305082 1041 "selection" 13194139534714 true] [17592186305082 1104 #edb/ref 17592186305083 13194139534714 true] [17592186305082 1110 #uuid "4376d4a2-a801-5b88-bf49-651fd4b633ef" 13194139534714 true] [17592186305083 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139534714 true] [17592186305083 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534714 true] [17592186305083 1111 #uuid "8c33f874-f544-539d-b546-5bbe8d5ccf1e" 13194139534714 true] [17592186305084 1034 "2" 13194139534714 true] [17592186305084 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534714 true] [17592186305084 1111 #uuid "1aeaae26-77d5-53e3-a502-e45359f074ba" 13194139534714 true] [17592186305085 1034 "1" 13194139534714 true] [17592186305085 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534714 true] [17592186305085 1111 #uuid "04f93f28-7377-5415-b029-9acacd84ccc5" 13194139534714 true] [17592186305086 1034 "\\frac{3}{2}" 13194139534714 true] [17592186305086 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534714 true] [17592186305086 1111 #uuid "fbef4d6c-